{"id":"leetcode-3684","version":1,"status":"approved","title":"Maximize Sum of At Most K Distinct Elements","summary":"Given a positive integer array nums and an integer k, select at most k distinct elements to maximize their sum.","statement":"Given a positive integer array nums and an integer k, select at most k distinct elements to maximize their sum. Return these elements in strictly descending order.","constraints":["Select at most k distinct values from the positive array.","Maximize their sum.","Return the selected values in strictly descending order."],"topics":["arrays","sets","sorting","greedy"],"prerequisites":[],"signature":{"name":"maximum_k_distinct_elements","parameters":[{"name":"nums","annotation":"list[int]","adapter":"raw","source_parameter":null},{"name":"k","annotation":"int","adapter":"raw","source_parameter":null}],"returns":"list[int]","return_adapter":"raw","node_policy":"values","result_mode":"return","mutated_parameter":null,"immutable_parameters":[]},"starter_code":"def maximum_k_distinct_elements(nums: list[int], k: int) -> list[int]:\n    # Write your solution here.\n    pass\n","reference_solution":"def maximum_k_distinct_elements(nums,k):\n    return sorted(set(nums),reverse=True)[:k]\n","brute_force_solution":null,"known_wrong_solutions":["def maximum_k_distinct_elements(nums,k):\n    return sorted(nums,reverse=True)[:k]\n","def maximum_k_distinct_elements(nums,k):\n    return sorted(set(nums),reverse=False)[:k]\n"],"target_time_complexity":"O(n log n)","target_space_complexity":"O(n)","estimated_minutes":20,"rubric":{"algorithmic_insight":1,"prerequisites":1,"implementation":1,"performance_pressure":0,"edge_cases":0},"hints":["Remove duplicates with a set.","Because values are positive, adding a larger distinct value always improves the sum.","Sort distinct values descending and keep the first k.","The returned order is already strictly descending."],"editorial":"The returned order is already strictly descending.","tests":[{"id":"lc